China didn't waste any time sending a negotiator to Taipei to prepare a summit on the protection of investment and medical cooperation.
Undoubtedly, he would also like to achieve political integration, but the first is the first.
It will be best to wait until the 2012 presidential elections will pass for it.
Either way, the PDP has reinvented itself.
