President from 2000 to 2008, he openly instigated explicit independence.
However, under the leadership of Ms. Tsai, a new generation of moderates has sprung up and the PDP is struggling to attract professionals and young people.
Ms. Tsai has been pleasantly regarded as PDP's candidate for the presidency, as has Su Tseng-chang, who served under Chen.
